1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,760
 Marching boots lining up in the street.

2
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:14,880
 Broken glass at a three minute speech.

3
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:19,880
 Posters peel but the slogans stay new.

4
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:25,960
 History repeats but the shade is still true.

5
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:31,040
 Sneakers stained with the paint on the walls.

6
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:36,320
 Truth gets lost in a parade of calls.

7
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:41,320
 Blank devotion dressed up for the show.

8
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:45,760
 How much flag do you need just to know?

9
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:50,760
 You want red, white, and blue in your bed.

10
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:55,640
 Tis a fact, let it cover your head.

11
00:00:55,640 --> 00:01:00,040
 Got the stars in your eye, fight on a crew.

12
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:06,080
 Fifty shades of red, white, and blue.

13
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:16,240
 Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

14
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:21,320
 Wave the banners at the mirror every day.

15
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:26,200
 Gradually just to the comfort on display.

16
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:30,880
 Shaded green upon the rush of being right.

17
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:36,360
 Raps so tight you can't see any light.

18
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:41,640
 Disalimated every anthem played.

19
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:47,880
 Worship power like the game you made.

20
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:52,960
 You want red, white, and blue in your bed.

21
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:57,880
 Just a flag, let it cover your head.

22
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:02,400
 You got the stars in your eyes, fight on a crew.

23
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:07,360
 Fifty shades of red, white, and blue.

24
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:27,880
 [BLANK_AUDIO]

